# App Footprint After Migration (2026-06-17)

## Rule

**New domain code MUST live in `Modules/{Name}/app/`** (Clean Architecture layers).  
**Do NOT** add controllers, services, models, mail, or notifications under `app/` unless listed below.

`app/Modules/` is **removed** — never recreate it.

## Allowed in `app/` (only)

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `Http/Controllers/Controller.php`, `HealthController.php` | Laravel base + health probe |
| `Http/Controllers/Api/V1/Mobile/Support/*` | Mobile JSON contract (`MobileResponse`, etc.) |
| `Services/BrainFallbackService.php` | LLM fallback chain |
| `Services/Clinic/ClinicAuthorizationService.php` | Blade `@canClinic` — fixed signatures |
| `Providers/*` | Bootstrap, morphMap, Gate::before |
| `Models/*.php` shims | `class X extends Modules\...\Domain\Models\X {}` only — **never** full Eloquent here |
| `Support/*.php` shims | `extends Modules\...\Infrastructure\Support\X` — real code in module |
| `Observers/*.php` shims | `extends Modules\...\Infrastructure\Observers\X` |
| `Mail/*.php` | **Shims only** once moved — full Mailables → `Modules/{Name}/app/Infrastructure/Mail/` |
| `Notifications/*.php` | **Shims only** once moved → `Modules/{Name}/app/Infrastructure/Notifications/` |
| `Http/Middleware/*` | Global/kernel middleware until moved per module |
| `Console/Commands/*` | Cross-app ops + `migration:find-unwrapped-controllers` |
| `Infrastructure/Migration/*` | App-wide HTTP audit tooling only |
| `Exceptions/Handler.php` | Global exception handling |

## Forbidden in `app/`

- New `app/Modules/{Name}/`
- New fat controllers with business logic
- New `app/Services/{Domain}*` (use `Modules/{Name}/app/Application/Services/`)
- New full Eloquent models (use module `Domain/Models/` + shim if needed)
- **New full `app/Mail/*` or `app/Notifications/*`** — search `Modules/` first; move, don't duplicate
- **New `app/Support/*` with business logic** — only one-line shims to module
- Migration/refactor scripts in `scripts/` (use module `Infrastructure/Migration/`)

## Before creating ANY file

1. `grep -rn "ClassName" Modules/ app/ routes/` — reuse or move existing
2. Place in `Modules/{Name}/app/{Application|Domain|Infrastructure|Presentation}/`
3. If old `App\` namespace still referenced: add **shim only** in `app/`, not full copy

## Verify

```bash
php artisan migration:find-unwrapped-controllers  # → 0
```

Full audit: `docs/refactoring/MODULE_AUDIT.md`
